        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 1 Knockmaree, Lucan Road, Chapelizod, Dublin 20 to the market a truly exceptional three-bedroom, two-bathroom end of terrace own door duplex presented in immaculate turnkey condition throughout. Ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after development, No. 1 enjoys a peaceful setting just moments from the charming village of Chapelizod. Residents are spoiled for choice with a fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, local shops and recreational amenities nearby, while the magnificent Phoenix Park is just a short stroll away. The property also benefits from excellent transport links with numerous Dublin Bus routes on the doorstep and convenient access to the N4, M50 and Dublin City Centre.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to c. 89 sqm, and comprises of private own door entrance, welcoming entrance hallway, generous open plan lounge and dining area, contemporary fully fitted kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms including a master ensuite, and a stylish main family bathroom. The property boasts a practical and well-balanced layout with an abundance of natural light flowing throughout.\n\nNo. 1 has been completely renovated from top to bottom to an exceptional standard, with every detail carefully considered to create a stylish, contemporary home ready for immediate occupation. Finished with high-quality fixtures and fittings throughout, this superb property offers the successful purchaser the opportunity to simply unpack and enjoy.\n\nRarely does a turnkey home of this calibre become available in such a convenient and desirable location. Combining spacious accommodation, own door access, premium finishes and a fantastic setting close to Chapelizod Village and Phoenix Park, No. 1 is sure to appeal to first time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize alike. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray\n\nAdditional Features;\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 89 sqm</li>\n <li>BER C</li>\n <li>3 Bed / 2 Bath</li>\n <li>End of terrace duplex</li>\n <li>Designated parking</li>\n <li>Gas heating</li>\n <li>Management fees c. 1,200 per annum</li>\n <li>Double glazed windows</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Sunny rear patio area</li>\n <li>Turn key condition</li>\n <li>Bright and airy</li>\n <li>Well-proportioned layout throughout</li>\n <li>Plenty of transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Wide range of local amenities within walking distance</li>\n <li>Highly sought after location</li>\n <li>Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\nDirections;\nEircode: D20 DP35"
      },
      {
